{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41824","headline":"送致仕沈彬郎中游茅山 · 李中","name":"送致仕沈彬郎中游茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挂却朝冠披鹤氅，羽人相伴恣遨游。\n忽因风月思茅岭，便挈琴樽上叶舟。\n野寺宿时魂梦冷，海门吟处水云秋。\n华阳洞府年光永，莫向仙乡拟驻留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}